    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a scenic horse ranch to experience the joy and pride of caring for a world-class stable of horses in Rival Stars Horse Racing: VR Edition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a friendly mentor, you\u2019ll raise charming foals, care for and train a stable of unique horses, and compete to become a champion racer and rider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/89fa938e9e9297014515fdc30526c963.poster.avif?t=1744909243\" width=770 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/89fa938e9e9297014515fdc30526c963.webm?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/89fa938e9e9297014515fdc30526c963.mp4?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A BOND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being an equestrian is about so much more than winning the next race. Get to know your horses and form close bonds through realistic and fulfilling interactions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your horses their favorite treats, keep them well-groomed, and give them a scratch in just the right spot to see them stretch out their necks in delight! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No task list \u2014 Enjoy time with your horses at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/00d767b0690f512118f557fd073416fc.poster.avif?t=1744909243\" width=770 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/00d767b0690f512118f557fd073416fc.webm?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/00d767b0690f512118f557fd073416fc.mp4?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR STABLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your horses to discover new coats and patterns on adorable foals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your stables with future champions and train them to compete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy watching horses roll and play in the pasture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the leafy grounds of your ranch and experience the relaxation of riding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/f2ca49ecac9ca928a39d3aaba9c66a42.poster.avif?t=1744909243\" width=770 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/f2ca49ecac9ca928a39d3aaba9c66a42.webm?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/f2ca49ecac9ca928a39d3aaba9c66a42.mp4?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A CHAMPION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a professional rider using the lifelike and intuitive riding controls. Just pick up the reins, and ride!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the excitement of the racetrack and discover locations from around the world in Story and Multiplayer racing modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race over jumps and against the clock in stunning Cross Country environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Rival Stars Horse Racing: VR Edition is a brand new, immersive experience built from the ground up for VR, please note that there is no cross-play with other titles in the Rival Stars Horse Racing franchise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMING SOON - WISHLIST NOW!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a scenic horse ranch to experience the joy and pride of caring for a world-class stable of horses in Rival Stars Horse Racing: VR Edition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a friendly mentor, you\u2019ll raise charming foals, care for and train a stable of unique horses, and compete to become a champion racer and rider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/89fa938e9e9297014515fdc30526c963.poster.avif?t=1744909243\" width=770 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/89fa938e9e9297014515fdc30526c963.webm?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/89fa938e9e9297014515fdc30526c963.mp4?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A BOND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being an equestrian is about so much more than winning the next race. Get to know your horses and form close bonds through realistic and fulfilling interactions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your horses their favorite treats, keep them well-groomed, and give them a scratch in just the right spot to see them stretch out their necks in delight! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No task list \u2014 Enjoy time with your horses at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/00d767b0690f512118f557fd073416fc.poster.avif?t=1744909243\" width=770 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/00d767b0690f512118f557fd073416fc.webm?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/00d767b0690f512118f557fd073416fc.mp4?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR STABLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your horses to discover new coats and patterns on adorable foals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your stables with future champions and train them to compete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy watching horses roll and play in the pasture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the leafy grounds of your ranch and experience the relaxation of riding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/f2ca49ecac9ca928a39d3aaba9c66a42.poster.avif?t=1744909243\" width=770 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/f2ca49ecac9ca928a39d3aaba9c66a42.webm?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937440/extras/f2ca49ecac9ca928a39d3aaba9c66a42.mp4?t=1744909243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A CHAMPION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a professional rider using the lifelike and intuitive riding controls. Just pick up the reins, and ride!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the excitement of the racetrack and discover locations from around the world in Story and Multiplayer racing modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race over jumps and against the clock in stunning Cross Country environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Rival Stars Horse Racing: VR Edition is a brand new, immersive experience built from the ground up for VR, please note that there is no cross-play with other titles in the Rival Stars Horse Racing franchise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMING SOON - WISHLIST NOW!</p>",
    "short_description": "Rival Stars Horse Racing: VR Edition is an immersive simulation game where you can become an equestrian champion from the comfort of your home. Raise, care for, and bond with your dream horses on a scenic ranch, then experience the thrill of the race track and the joy of horse riding!",
